e same type (ie it can't correspond\n\t    to a straight line in one font and a curve in another) "},"\n\t    輪郭上の各スプラインは同じ型でなければならない (例えば、あるフォントにおける直線に、別のフォントの曲線が対応づけられていてはいけないということです)。\n\t"]}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"li","attributes":{},"children":["\n",{"comment":"\tReferences "},"\n\t参照\n\t",{"tag":"ul","attributes":{},"children":["\n",{"tag":"li","attributes":{},"children":["\n",{"comment":"\t    There must be the same number of references and "},"\n\t    ちょうど同じ個数の参照が存在しなければならず、\n\t  "]},{"tag":"li","attributes":{},"children":["\n",{"comment":"\t    Each corresponding reference must refer to the same encoding "},"\n\t    対応する各参照は同じ文字コードを参照していなければならない\n\t"]}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"li","attributes":{},"children":["\n",{"comment":"\tHints "},"\n\tヒント\n\t",{"tag":"ul","attributes":{},"children":["\n",{"tag":"li","attributes":{},"children":["\n",{"comment":"\t    Same number of hints "},"\n\t    同じ個数のヒント\n\t"]}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"li","attributes":{},"children":["\n",{"comment":"\tHintMasks (Counter masks are not supported here) "},"\n\tヒントマスク (この場合、カウンタマスクはサポートされていません)\n\t",{"tag":"ul","attributes":{},"children":["\n",{"tag":"li","attributes":{},"children":["\n",{"comment":"\t    HintMasks at corresponding points must specify a corresponding set of hints "},"\n\t    対応する点に位置するヒントマスクは対応するヒントセットを指定していなければならない\n\t"]}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"li","attributes":{},"children":["\n",{"comment":"\tKerning "},"\n\tカーニング\n\t",{"tag":"ul","attributes":{},"children":["\n",{"tag":"li","attributes":{},"children":["\n",{"comment":"\t    If a glyph kerns with another glyph in one font, then a corresponding kerning\n\t    pair must exist in all designs "},"\n\t    ある文字と別の文字が 1 個のフォントでカーニングの対象になるとしたら、対応するカーニングペアがすべてのデザインに存在しなければならない\n\t"]}]},"\n"]}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"dt","attributes":{},"children":["\n",{"comment":"<A NAME=\"Info\">MM Info</A>"},"\n",{"tag":"a","attributes":{"name":"Info"},"children":["マルチプルマスター情報(",{"tag":"u","attributes":{},"children":["I"]},")"]},"...\n  "]},{"tag":"dd","attributes":{},"chi